        "condition:bloodlust" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Add a wound token here whenever you kill an enemy. On activation: fewer than 2 tokens means take 2 stress; otherwise discard every token and heal that much stress.", "", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7194667", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
