        "condition:claustrophobia" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("With at most 2 adjacent spaces, take 2 stress; otherwise heal stress equal to the adjacent-space count.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:compulsive-accumulating" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Before resolving each insanity threshold, add a wound token here. Count Items plus Companions: if below your token count, take the difference in stress; otherwise clear your stress.", "", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7194665", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:fear-of-crowds" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Take 1 stress per other figure in your space. Alone, clear your stress instead.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
