        "condition:hypochondria" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Take stress equal to your wounds, excluding Companion wounds. Unwounded, clear your stress.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:hyperactivity" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Gain the Hyperactive token and take 2 stress. While holding it, gain an extra action and cannot Rest. Discard it when drawing your turn’s Mythos card.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:impulsive-aggression" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Without enemies present, every investigator in your space, including you, takes 1 wound. Otherwise, wound one enemy there by your current stress amount.", "", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7194666", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:kleptomania" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Steal at least one Item, Companion or tradable episode token from investigators present to clear stress; if impossible, take 2 stress.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:masochism" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Record wounds taken with wound tokens here. On activation, no tokens means take 1 wound; otherwise discard all tokens and heal that much stress.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:megalomania" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Clear your stress if no other living investigator has reached more insanity thresholds than you; otherwise take 2 stress.", "", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7194665", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:narcolepsy" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Rest caused by this insanity ignores safety and other Rest restrictions. If your next action this turn could be Rest, it must be; otherwise take a free Rest healing 3 stress/wounds.", "", "https://gamefound.com/en/projects/asmodee/dmd-forbidden-reaches/updates/41", "Preview-source draft: confirm whether “next action” wording and healing match your printed edition."),
        "condition:overcaring" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("At setup, choose a protected investigator. When together, heal all their wounds and clear your stress. Otherwise, take stress equal to their wounds; a dead protected investigator causes no effect.", "", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7194664", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:pyromania" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Add Fire to your space, then wound every other figure there by the number of Fire tokens present.", "", "https://thesolomeeple.com/2021/10/19/first-thoughts-just-another-lovecraft-game/", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:recurring-trauma" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Keep the latest Mythos card drawn by any player that lacks a summoning symbol, replacing the previous one. On activation, resolve that card again; if none is kept, clear stress. Return the kept card when Mythos discards are reshuffled.", "", "https://rules.dized.com/game/kp6yXekcT6agDFGangIB1Q/faq", "Verify the entire card, especially the no-card branch and interaction with draw-another-Mythos symbols."),
        "condition:shared-psychosis" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Resolve the nearest investigator’s insanity within 2 spaces as your own. With nobody in range, take 2 stress.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:short-term-memory-loss" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("At maximum stress, clear it and discard a chosen Discovery card; otherwise take 1 stress.", "", "https://cthulhu-death-may-die.fandom.com/wiki/Insanaties", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "condition:traveling-fugue" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("If possible, move to a space two spaces from where you began. Enemies follow.", "", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7194664", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "relic:replica-blade" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Add 1 green die when attacking a target in your space.", "Excalibur: add 2 green dice when attacking a target in your space.", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7155578", "Check both faces and enter the printed flip requirement in the starting-face notes."),
        "relic:shiny-jewel" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Raise your signature skill by 1 level.", "Shining Trapezohedron: raise your signature skill by 1 additional level.", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7155578", "Confirm signature skill, level cap and both face effects; add the printed flip requirement."),
        "relic:viol" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Rest while unsafe; heal 1 extra stress when Resting.", "Doomed Viol: Rest while unsafe, healing 1 extra stress and dealing 1 wound to every enemy present.", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7193296", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "relic:wooden-pipe" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("Gain 2 free rerolls per roll while on an insanity threshold.", "Transcendental Herbs: gain 3 free rerolls per roll while on a threshold or the preceding space.", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7193296", "Compare timing, quantities, symbols and exceptions with your printed card."),
        "relic:glowing-ring" to InvestigatorRulesDraft("On any roll, each tentacle may also count as 1 success; it remains a tentacle.", "Spectral Ring: each tentacle may also count as 2 successes on any roll; it remains a tentacle.", "https://boardgamegeek.com/image/7193296", "Confirm tentacle symbols and success quantities, then enter the printed flip requirement."),
